{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_969.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"aed53a386f5d9cd3df2b7b4d372f4e2a28b683d1b04c2eba57ddfe0a270dd134","ja":"瑞希の欲しいもの","zh":"瑞希想要的东西","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_969.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"e24212e610cee506706907e1166e91fde41d26675105ae9b3d6e6c816fe5a68b","ja":"ふぅ～、お仕事楽しかった～♪","zh":"呼～，工作好开心～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_969.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"0c40c8c4ca80f0924218a3e067ba22be73ddd38c9db9d95fd73cd603f9462893","ja":"ねえ、ミズキ！　せっかくショッピングモールに\n来たんだし、買い物してから帰ろうヨ？","zh":"喂，美希！既然好不容易来了一趟购物中心，\n不如买点东西再回去吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_969.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"304ca0d3d44c183bfc89763e1bdcbd51a4e5dcf67f780bcded9b4a9ec5faf489","ja":"はい、ぜひ行きましょう。\n……文房具店、このあたりにあったかな……？","zh":"好的，一起去吧。\n……文具店，这附近有吗……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_969.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"042b54c2e1d207d0fcc91fb36d5d06dc9067533581fcb05ba67fb75a170f5449","ja":"あっ、欲しいものあるノ？\n学校で使う物とか？","zh":"啊，有想要的东西吗？\n比如学校里用的东西？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_969.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"9b4d667cb30b9aa663dafabe0850038dff047d171e15bc81601199aca2bd9ed7","ja":"いえ、実は年賀状を書こうかと\n思っていたところでした。","zh":"不，其实我正想着\n要不要写贺年卡呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_969.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"2046989966524cfd7e9ecab93b745240fb5ebbe354e865ff904395a94feda60a","ja":"この間、父が大量の年賀状づくりをしていたのです。\nお仕事でお世話になった方にお礼に、と。","zh":"前些天，父亲在大量制作贺年卡。\n说是为了感谢在工作中关照过他的人。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_969.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"d70abf4946cb7e41a8882b83d7d138290971052ce7bf71984776dbe86e5632cc","ja":"それを見ていたら、私もいろいろな人に\n感謝の気持ちを伝えたくなりました。","zh":"看到那个之后，我也想要向各种各样的人\n传达感谢的心情。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_969.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"cc28d496866b207dab8b6bde2a4d0d348d640e47bbfca0bc3e9ff2fe6dd74523","ja":"わぁ、それいいネ！　ワタシも感謝の気持ちを書くヨ！\nじゃあ今から、ハガキを買いに行こう♪","zh":"哇，那真不错呢！我也要写下感谢的心情！\n那我们现在就去买明信片吧♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_969.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"ece7e40075a071edd414a8277a4f0e131a0c2e88371ec6a440f4ce6c6ffbc3f2","ja":"はい。では、いざゆかん……ハガキ以外にも、\nいろいろと必要な気がしてきたぞ。","zh":"好。那么，出发吧……除了明信片之外，\n我还觉得需要各种各样的东西。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_969.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"be522cdd60b3bb8ef599be1a6764bec317d6c049b533d44cc7e32483489ea7eb","ja":"そうだネ！　ペンは劇場にあるけど……\nスタンプとか、シールとかもいるんじゃないかナ！？","zh":"对了！笔在剧场里有，不过……\n印章啊、贴纸啊是不是也需要呢！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_969.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"713b10fb3a3824860a30bb520c804daaf7b62de8a2adc7da45d9742acbc0ad6c","ja":"ねぇねぇ、ハガキと一緒にそういうのも\n買っていこうヨ！　オリジナル年賀状のために♪","zh":"呐呐，和明信片一起也买那种东西\n买吧！为了原创贺年卡♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_969.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"7ee32028a2fe8e5739d67bdb2b7e651d7823910a30de3ffb51be184f0fe4fdee","ja":"はい……何やら本格的な買い出しになってしまった。\n頑張るぞ。","zh":"好……不知怎么的，变成了一场正经的采购。\n加油吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_969.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"5b61eaed0dbf2faf9a747b6ba78f5db7a334c0ac1f4abb7607ce34fc579a5803","ja":"うん！　せっかく書くんだもん、キラキラな\n年賀状を書いて、みんなに気持ちを伝えないとネ♪","zh":"嗯！难得要写，就写一张闪闪发亮的\n贺年卡，把心意传达给大家才行呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
